solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_EiwkkH6IfUecKbw6GMI-OQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:FinancialLiabilities" scale="0" id="Tc_oxdr56lQr0aAG6W0lZa27Q_7_2">11,447,737</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_EiwkkH6IfUecKbw6GMI-OQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:FinancialLiabilitiesUndiscountedCashFlows" scale="0" id="Tc_9VhYMZcr2keqigbtlYDeoQ_7_4">7,665,340</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_ifrs-full_MaturityAxis_ifrs-full_NotLaterThanOneYearMember_Oq3iccUowkGnl1UmSfrfaA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:FinancialLiabilitiesUndiscountedCashFlows" scale="0" id="Tc_cyr3J3P9pEulopEkuMG5yA_7_6">4,040,340</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.7%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.84%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_ifrs-full_MaturityAxis_ifrs-full_LaterThanOneYearAndNotLaterThanThreeYearsMember_ZHKm0kFD7kKjhlDBxxAzTQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:FinancialLiabilitiesUndiscountedCashFlows" scale="0" id="Tc_TUB10N1LQUqnVADN0ThJqA_7_8">3,625,000</ix:nonFraction></b></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-weight:bold;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Interest rate risk</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Interest rate risk is the risk that the fair value of future cash flows of a financial instrument will fluctuate because of changes in market interest rates. The Company has no significant interest-bearing assets or liabilities and therefore its income and operating cash flows are substantially independent of changes in market interest rates.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Foreign exchange risk</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Foreign currency risk is the risk that the fair values of future cash flows of a financial instrument will fluctuate because they are denominated in currencies that differ from the respective functional currency.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As at March&#160;31, 2024, a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_csGVPTI6LEiHjYWu44qMSw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_EiwkkH6IfUecKbw6GMI-OQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:PercentageOfReasonablyPossibleChangeInRiskAssumption" scale="-2" id="Narr_ItuVcErS6E2nsG4_0D25cQ">10</ix:nonFraction>% fluctuation in foreign exchange rates would result in a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2023_To_3_31_2024_SXKabfbue0KLjKL7OMxylQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IncreaseDecreaseInProfitOrLossDueToReasonablyPossibleChangeInDesignatedRiskComponent" scale="0" id="Narr_NGHfl-qvfkqcIhdAGozkzg">4,139</ix:nonFraction> impact to net loss and comprehensive loss.</p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2023_To_3_31_2024_SXKabfbue0KLjKL7OMxylQ" name="ifrs-full:DisclosureOfEventsAfterReportingPeriodExplanatory" id="Tb_z5-7y73cy0eK_m07ydNqKg" continuedAt="Tb_z5-7y73cy0eK_m07ydNqKg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">19. Subsequent Events</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 16, 2024, the Company issued an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_5_16_2024_To_5_16_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SharesIssuedToThirdPartyConsultantsAndLegalAdvisorsMember_YLWJ9YBD9UO59gmGJhiR2w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_GN_CWgd_RUaMlMVL264QtA">2,373</ix:nonFraction> shares to third - party consultants and legal advisors.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company has received additional financing of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_IAqFQDOe1UCpf6CDyuliOw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_iLHM-jGqOkqWq37UusvuNQ">1,000,000</ix:nonFraction> related to the Second Tranche of convertible notes:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On May&#160;31, 2024, the Company received proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_5_31_2024_To_5_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_y97gokXhzk-GNFG8qA33Xg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" scale="0" id="Narr_z2IH2AwZ3US9_xJUf5vv_Q">250,000</ix:nonFraction> related to the issuance of the Second Tranche Notes. The principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_grLgrWXj4EiTFjtVK1PbLA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_Fmwdqs8A50uQQUDT2z_kig">312,250</ix:nonFraction> was issued under the same terms as the First Tranche Notes, with interest accruing at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_csGVPTI6LEiHjYWu44qMSw" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_grLgrWXj4EiTFjtVK1PbLA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_mRFJ7QIy3UmO8V-kSFdk3g">8.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum from the issuance date. The Conversion Price remains subject to adjustment as per the terms outlined in the original Securities Purchase Agreement.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On June&#160;17, 2024, an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_6_17_2024_To_6_17_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_sdiB1v5M-EWYiEbu6jzsbA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" scale="0" id="Narr_lBQlvVrEcE657HsM7hRxvQ">250,000</ix:nonFraction> in proceeds was received by the Company for the issuance of the Second Tranche Notes. The principal amount issued was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_6_17_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_o3VvBjVt1kyQEVn_0tV2Yg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_0GQDDoPfkkmMj36ijiwCxg">312,250</ix:nonFraction>, also under the terms consistent with the First Tranche Notes. Interest accrues at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_csGVPTI6LEiHjYWu44qMSw" contextRef="As_Of_6_17_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_QM7eD93n802t5beYsqJmKg" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_xTBg7y0YN0GsHCNGvpsDIw">8.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum from the date of issuance, with the Conversion Price subject to the same adjustment mechanisms detailed in the initial agreement.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On July 15, 2024, an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_7_15_2024_To_7_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_ogNHZqcevkK3JZ2Bwnb8AQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromBorrowingsClassifiedAsFinancingActivities" scale="0" id="Narr_Lw3vpk5sfUKa3Zoz7-g2uA">500,000</ix:nonFraction> in proceeds was received by the Company for the issuance of the Second Tranche Notes. The principal amount issued was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_vBtSzjH0YU6BwXbL5td_1Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:NotionalAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_2QU7iIsFWEmLMyjAUk6QtQ">625,000</ix:nonFraction>, also under the terms consistent with the First Tranche Notes. Interest accrues at <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_csGVPTI6LEiHjYWu44qMSw" contextRef="As_Of_7_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SecondTrancheNoteMember_nanv6wXPLkKQRirUvydoAA" decimals="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:BorrowingsInterestRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_pa_IePxmn0Sjx3ajQ0S5Yw">8.0</ix:nonFraction>% per annum from the date of issuance, with the Conversion Price subject to the same adjustment mechanisms detailed in the initial agreement.</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">These subsequent financings are part of the Convertible Note&#160;Financing arrangement entered into in connection with the RTO Transaction.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d3002.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:28.5pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:87.75pt;"/></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">29</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">PSYENCE BIOMEDICAL LTD.</b></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line:none;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_z5-7y73cy0eK_m07ydNqKg_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_z5-7y73cy0eK_m07ydNqKg_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company has received <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_s-l1VIqG9Uanppx6r9y-Ww" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2023_To_3_31_2024_SXKabfbue0KLjKL7OMxylQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="pbm:NumberOfConversionNotices" scale="0" id="Narr_ux2Q25vtdUGf3aAVWgTi1Q">two</ix:nonFraction> conversion notices related to the First Tranche of convertible notes:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On May&#160;15, 2024, a conversion notice was received for a principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CAD_UKntLULJbkaokFHT4XTVUg" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2024_To_5_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_feecnz5BV0KFVK04gbLjzQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_YPUaFWQ5BUyfgfs2At1QyA">70,000</ix:nonFraction>. This amount converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2024_To_5_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_feecnz5BV0KFVK04gbLjzQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_nXEkFDuOSUWGYWHYOYsBZA">40.21</ix:nonFraction> per share, resulting in the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2024_To_5_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_feecnz5BV0KFVK04gbLjzQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_LQ3qQ_8mZkSDBPY5w187JQ">1,741</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On June&#160;20, 2024, a second conversion notice was received for a principal amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_6_20_2024_To_6_20_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_gaHEzoCU-kKKt02wquKR5g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_bnRCE_VSUUqQhy1UeUFfGg">1,072,200</ix:nonFraction>. This converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_6_20_2024_To_6_20_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_gaHEzoCU-kKKt02wquKR5g" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_gafS7F4NC0ipBnvMZtyuYQ">40.21</ix:nonFraction> per share, leading to the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_6_20_2024_To_6_20_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_FirstTrancheNoteMember_gaHEzoCU-kKKt02wquKR5g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_jISPeEywukq3SmKm-ZwY3Q">26,667</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">Concurrently, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2024_To_5_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_E2bmXDFYmkufB8kxhi3hkw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_BeJBtxq3XU-aqSa89GN5wg">1,157</ix:nonFraction> shares on May&#160;15, 2024, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_6_20_2024_To_6_20_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_IkLREEGUjkea3S6xFk9HZQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_-mjvifANc02qmmn7Yn-4-w">1,047</ix:nonFraction> shares on June&#160;20, 2024, to cover outstanding interest on the outstanding principal at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_5_15_2024_To_5_15_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_E2bmXDFYmkufB8kxhi3hkw" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_LpZnm_Cteke1skMhijwSaA"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_6_20_2024_To_6_20_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_IkLREEGUjkea3S6xFk9HZQ" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_PgN17xAGakCqaE_ZeYI6vw">40.21</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> per share.</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 20, 2024, the Company and the Investor signed an addendum to the securities purchase agreement, which requires the Investor to convert the outstanding notes into common shares as soon as possible, within the limits of the agreement. As part of the Addendum, the Investor received <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="As_Of_8_20_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_RnY4E4W6UUuXZKzFnM6TlQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_XZXJrLsoFUicsuXh51XyNw">13,333</ix:nonFraction> common shares and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2024_To_8_20_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_SlnW3YS-SkOL7I_orNK6AA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:WarrantsIssuedOnConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_zhQU2Cr5ZUeOI6zgpiFKfw">6,667</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_4IAuaH2CgUODKa220BAhrw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">two</span></span>-year expiry, exercisable at $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_8_20_2024_To_8_20_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_SlnW3YS-SkOL7I_orNK6AA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_gXo5ypJ1i0SWbU42N30H2Q">37.50</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On September 4, 2024, a conversion notice was received for a principal amount of USD $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_4_2024_To_9_4_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_wPLOBTt0a0aVOiFDNUjDNg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_ZDi3glEx1kipiH1-HnsrMA">675,180</ix:nonFraction>. This converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_4_2024_To_9_4_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_wPLOBTt0a0aVOiFDNUjDNg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_JIZcvnxg3kSgY6TJV1RBxw">28.13</ix:nonFraction> per share, leading to the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_4_2024_To_9_4_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_wPLOBTt0a0aVOiFDNUjDNg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_EN2mPvWvtEa-gOGdBGDmyw">24,000</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On September 6, 2024, a conversion notice was received for a principal amount of USD $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_6_2024_To_9_6_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_9Us-uexF106-WdDGMGsyXw" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_LtqjcxeqD0aCIW3Q5-V-1g">375,100</ix:nonFraction>. This converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_6_2024_To_9_6_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_9Us-uexF106-WdDGMGsyXw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_XyUKJm70_kasKc5zPKIveA">28.13</ix:nonFraction> per share, leading to the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_6_2024_To_9_6_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_9Us-uexF106-WdDGMGsyXw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_vYBh0Aho3kGAepfuiJbOVA">13,333</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On September 10, 2024, a conversion notice was received for a principal amount of USD $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_10_2024_To_9_10_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ArVOPgRo_Euz5u8-_0k3DA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_RMkc9vuqwU2z4711kCTerA">600,160</ix:nonFraction>. This converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_10_2024_To_9_10_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ArVOPgRo_Euz5u8-_0k3DA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_FwksbcBwDEGIb_jtuzJBCg">28.13</ix:nonFraction> per share, leading to the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_10_2024_To_9_10_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ArVOPgRo_Euz5u8-_0k3DA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_wZEqswXmUE6X0DlWz941GQ">21,333</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;border:0;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">-</p></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;text-align:justify;">On September 19, 2024, a conversion notice was received for a principal amount of USD $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_19_2024_To_9_19_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_bLeD3zK2w0SSIVnXZVcJjg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_UjFD2Z7U20qucxCweu6oEw">1,258,364</ix:nonFraction>. This converted at a VWAP of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_19_2024_To_9_19_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_bLeD3zK2w0SSIVnXZVcJjg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_cmJwydhLE0qQTldyHNZoFg">28.13</ix:nonFraction> per share, leading to the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_19_2024_To_9_19_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_bLeD3zK2w0SSIVnXZVcJjg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_hOTWQTbbM0qK6ID5Q3gigQ">44,730</ix:nonFraction> shares.</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">These conversions and interest issuances are in accordance with the terms outlined in the Securities Purchase Agreement and are related to the Convertible Note&#160;Financing arrangement initiated in connection with the RTO Transaction.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 27, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="As_Of_11_27_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_46zFEWYnjk6uwwNGAdAFEQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_rDfhk1YfHk-njqX0B5nxMw">182,323</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a nominal exercise price and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_11_27_2024_To_11_27_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_dmDYl0aYAkOlGpqJIscOag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_yvS5rQLvVkiu2sXVkXctuw">151,010</ix:nonFraction> common shares in full and final settlement of all provisions under the convertible note. The convertible note holder exercised the warrants on December 5, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In July, 2024, the Company completed a warrant exchange agreement with an unaffiliated third-party investor of warrants to purchase the Company&#8217;s common shares, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_7_31_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_UnaffiliatedThirdPartyInvestorMember_vSQJrO8GlESmjpxYiWX5nA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="ifrs-full:ParValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_ym4nULUUlUW_TUVdhZONuw">no</ix:nonFraction> par value per share, which warrants are currently trading on Nasdaq. Pursuant to the Warrant Exchange Agreement, the Company issued to the Holder <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_7_31_2024_ifrs-full_ComponentsOfEquityAxis_ifrs-full_IssuedCapitalMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_UnaffiliatedThirdPartyInvestorMember_pZYQDZXfTkWLVA64848Ylg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_qxayy3PXKkCHHF6sAeAzZA">8,800</ix:nonFraction> Common Shares in exchange for the surrender and cancellation of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_7_1_2024_To_7_31_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_PublicWarrantsMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_UnaffiliatedThirdPartyInvestorMember_V5m7s1OWtk22ORzhRR1HUQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_G40td0wWWkWJtyWvnHdE1A">8,800</ix:nonFraction> Public Warrants held by the Holder.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 12, 2024, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_8_12_2024_To_8_12_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_SharesIssuedToThirdPartyConsultantsAndLegalAdvisorsMember_4eg2vlZqzEKz61tB9WaO8w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_XoNQEgUCSUKfzGCpRti_IA">2,294</ix:nonFraction> shares to third-party consultants.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 28, 2024, the Company entered into a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_8_28_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ciRc60ggEEayS6xPgDlodA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsCommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_zMgg1lzMeUyMJ_rYpKruCw">25</ix:nonFraction> million equity line of credit (ELOC) agreement with White Lion Capital, LLC, which was declared effective by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC). This agreement allows the Company to sell up to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_8_28_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_ciRc60ggEEayS6xPgDlodA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsCommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="6" id="Narr_dQzUE3ZcZESKFvKSBWXSUA">25</ix:nonFraction> million in shares over a <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_x7AtPhN8O0-7uyX82Zjn7Q;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">24-month</span></span> period, subject to specific conditions outlined in the Purchase Agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Subsequent to year end the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_4_1_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_JhaMOv8PNUC9f_Rz070wsA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_ac5z1-G66EeoCJQkyWVBGw">1,744,635</ix:nonFraction> shares for gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_4_1_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_JhaMOv8PNUC9f_Rz070wsA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssuingShares" scale="0" id="Narr_hVbnrBNO60iLlD1mvf9ZTQ">6,677,598</ix:nonFraction> under the ELOC.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 30, 2024, the NCAC Note holder converted the entire outstanding principal balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_VLFrLcr3sk62_sSdt1M5Kg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_HnpsV0olJ0uXMa2u7l_6AQ">1,615,501</ix:nonFraction> into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_VLFrLcr3sk62_sSdt1M5Kg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_npe790uRn0-3W50M0E3LVw">43,080</ix:nonFraction> common shares at a conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_VLFrLcr3sk62_sSdt1M5Kg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_6cTHmfITKUCf-y-6tjs0xA">37.50</ix:nonFraction> per share. There is a make whole provision which entitled the NCAC Note holders to a top-up in shares if the share price was lower than the conversion price on September 30, 2024 at the make whole date.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 9, 2024 the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_UnsecuredConvertiblePromissoryNotesMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_4UE3TknBQk6c04vTeyk75g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_YmHU_YTdkECzVMI-Xm5liw">373,555</ix:nonFraction> common shares to settle the make whole entitlements under the NCAC promissory note. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 30, 2024, PGI converted $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_PgiPromissoryNoteMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_Nah_YsOYrE-ILrb9jk_VtA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionConvertedInstrumentAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_WccXnoRBj0KnZhMpzpn3vg">1,037,960</ix:nonFraction> of the PGI promissory note principal of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_PgiPromissoryNoteMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_Nah_YsOYrE-ILrb9jk_VtA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_8X9BVFrBhkSkhyilD2b1PA">1,460,657</ix:nonFraction> into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_PgiPromissoryNoteMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_Nah_YsOYrE-ILrb9jk_VtA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_jUevSjLqCkeJTaroaHkXqQ">27,679</ix:nonFraction> common shares at a conversion price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="Duration_9_30_2024_To_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_PgiPromissoryNoteMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_Nah_YsOYrE-ILrb9jk_VtA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:DebtConversionVolumeWeightedAveragePricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_Ipl95cjjp0OWD2UpbKnngQ">37.50</ix:nonFraction> per share. Following this conversion, the remaining principal balance was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="As_Of_9_30_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_PgiPromissoryNoteMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_iwm6JZ5xEE6HUihhAgwPOA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:CurrentDebtInstrumentsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_I2nnbRnTfkePcUouthKGIQ">422,697</ix:nonFraction>. There is a make whole provision which entitled the PGI Note holders to a top-up in shares if the share price was lower than the conversion price on September 30, 2024 at the make whole date. On October 25, 2024, for the PGI promissory note which had a remaining principal balance of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_10_25_2024_To_10_25_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_cOQVExrlvEieHokIjmpCJQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsDebtConversionOriginalDebtAmount1" scale="0" id="Narr_DqgcGgdcIkKXDAdNTyfLxA">422,697</ix:nonFraction>, was converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_25_2024_To_10_25_2024_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_pbm_EquityLineOfCreditAgreementMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_IfrsConvertibleDebtMember_cOQVExrlvEieHokIjmpCJQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesConversionOfConvertibleSecurities" scale="0" id="Narr_BqVZZIk4DkifD1OkwrH-NA">11,272</ix:nonFraction> common shares.</p></ix:continuation></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d3002.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:28.5pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:87.75pt;"/></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">30</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">PSYENCE BIOMEDICAL LTD.</b></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:100%;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration-line:none;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div><div style="clear:both;margin-left:-10.0pt;margin-right:-10.0pt;max-width:100%;position:relative;width:calc(100% + 20.0pt);"><div style="padding-left:10pt;padding-right:10pt;position:relative;width:100%;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_z5-7y73cy0eK_m07ydNqKg_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 28, 2024, the Company acquired <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_28_2024_To_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_LLrxeL-l2E2obhoGt5NDHw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:NumberOfSharesAcquired" scale="0" id="Narr_CSDQzphfVkWc_l-qf070Jg">1,000</ix:nonFraction> shares in Psyence Labs Ltd (Psy Labs) from PGI. PsyLabs is a private company headquartered in the BVI. PsyLabs is focused on the production of psychedelic active pharmaceutical ingredients and extracts. The Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_10_28_2024_To_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_LLrxeL-l2E2obhoGt5NDHw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForReverseTakeoverTransaction" scale="0" id="Narr_vAAd7mpzzk274yNygQJ0Dw">26,667</ix:nonFraction> common shares at a price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_10_28_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_OoDjZpJlOUqS9HeTfBfNtA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsSharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_vGH_Ja63dESQrP4k26JuYA">41.25</ix:nonFraction> per share in exchange for the shares in Psy Labs. There was also a make whole provision which entitled PGI to a top-up in shares if the share price at January 15, 2025 was lower than the share price on October 28, 2024.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 9, 2024 the Company issued to PGI <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_9_2024_To_12_9_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_pbm_ReverseMergerAgreementMember_2Q-ZfjxWb0-A-8aIp8pJhg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesIssuedForDebtSettlement" scale="0" id="Narr_kveW2TjJqka7u62oyUZviQ">594,771</ix:nonFraction> common shares to settle the make whole entitlements under the promissory note and purchase of shares in Psy Labs from PGI.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 26, 2024, the Company consolidated its common shares on the basis of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_OuiioPJrdk294zxWA_UwCw;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">75</span></span>:1.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On December 24, 2024 the Company entered into a private placement agreement with HC Wainwright. The Company received $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_HeGFnztaUESwmwhdTLq9LA" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_ifrs-full_MajorOrdinaryShareTransactionsMember_pbm_IfrsSaleOfStockAxis_pbm_IfrsPrivatePlacementMember_iUnbtCPtOU6EHADggeIyzA" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="ifrs-full:ProceedsFromIssueOfOrdinaryShares" scale="6" id="Narr_P9SVZLOj6UGPiGKFHjstOA">2</ix:nonFraction> million in gross proceeds for the issuance of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="Duration_12_24_2024_To_12_24_2024_SwiZxkXRxEWR2vtI-C1mGg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_vEOZakj-FEa2t50fh4lWtw">380,000</ix:nonFraction> common shares and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_xhlgGxMEGUOUX0OHQQVajw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_989arcqnnEaXzqLNmMCeaw">620,000</ix:nonFraction> pre-funded warrants with a nominal exercise price. In connection with the private placement, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice2Member_w0G0oy8am0us1_3rgCgjIg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_9ihdbcc3eUW0mAeXiDoYqg">2,000,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice2Member_w0G0oy8am0us1_3rgCgjIg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_jtfuDUb8zEiVTHm5uw35Tw">2</ix:nonFraction> exercise price and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_pvyiikKkpUa41tyBo3imug" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice250Member_4Xd07Wvko02vJ2jjmACHTA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:NumberOfWarrantsIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_ywwW1teQ8EyuPtJdUEjwZg">75,000</ix:nonFraction> warrants with a $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_I9kD_MQ8ME-OHUtxweJqhw" contextRef="As_Of_12_24_2024_ifrs-full_ClassesOfFinancialInstrumentsAxis_pbm_WarrantsWithExercisePrice250Member_4Xd07Wvko02vJ2jjmACHTA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="pbm:IfrsClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_xFU14w0kqUq8hPL2mIZyig">2.50</ix:nonFraction> exercise price.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="position:absolute;top:0pt;width:100%;"></div></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.33%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:top;width:33.34%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"><img src="pbm-20240930xex99d3002.jpg" alt="Graphic" style="display:inline-block;height:28.5pt;left:0%;padding-bottom:0pt;position:relative;top:0pt;width:87.75pt;"/></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:33.32%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt 5.4pt 0pt 5.4pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">31</p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></div></div>
